4,"Itik-Itik Dance: Origins, Music, Steps, Costume, and Style - Salsa Vida",https://www.salsavida.com/dancepedia/itik-itik-dance-philippines/,"November 9, 2025 - Many classroom and community versions of Itik-Itik are performed to “Dejado,” a light, lyrical tune that supports the buoyant quality of the steps. In ensembles with live accompaniment, rondalla instruments are common, especially bandurria and guitar families, which complement the hop, peck, and flutter motifs with bright, articulated strumming.",Itik,Tor-Kwerba
